>​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>传统部署（单一 Origin）：用户在上海，服务器在美西</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{TTFB}^{origin} = 150ms + T_{compute} + 150ms = 300ms + T_{compute}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2361em;vertical-align:-0.2935em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9426em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span style