"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>网络延迟的削减量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>290</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 290ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">290</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>）远超大多数计算优化能带来的收益。这就是边缘渲染的根本价值命题：<strong>消灭物理距离</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统架构&#10;        U1[上海用户] --&gt;|150ms| O[美西 Origin]&#10;        O --&gt;|150ms| U1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 边缘架构&#10;        U2[上海用户] --&gt;|5ms| E[上海 Edge]&#10;        E --&gt;|5ms| U2&#10;        E -.-&gt;|按需回源| O2[Origin]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统架构\n        U1[上海用户] --&gt;|150ms| O[美西 Origin]\n        O --&gt;|150ms| U1\n    end\n    subgraph 边缘架构\n        U2[上海用户] --&gt;|5ms| E[上海 Edge]\n        E --&gt;|5ms| U2\n        E -.-&gt;|按需回源| O2[Origin]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"edge-runtime-的约束模型\">Edge Runtime 的约束模型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束维度</th>\n<th>Edge Runtime</th>\n<th>Node.js Runtime</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行时间</td>\n<td>通常 ≤30s（Vercel: 30s，CF: 无限但有 CPU 限制）</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>128MB（CF Workers）/ 1GB（Vercel Edge）</td>\n<td>服务器内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>完全访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生模块</td>\n<td>不可用（无 Node-API）</td>\n<td>完全支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>~5ms（V8 Isolate）</td>\n<td>200-2000ms（容器/进程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局状态</td>\n<td>不保证（隔离执行）</td>\n<td>进程级别保持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络出口</td>\n<td>受限（避免回源瀑布）</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持的 API</td>\n<td>Web Standards（Fetch, Streams, Crypto）</td>\n<td>Node.js 全量 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>冷启动差异是 Edge 的核心竞争力之一：V8 Isolate 的启动时间（~5ms）比容器（200ms+）快 40 倍以上，这意味着即使是低频路由也不会有冷启动惩罚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构决策-什么放边缘-什么留-origin\">架构决策：什么放边缘，什么留 Origin</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{这段逻辑应该放哪里?} --&gt; B{需要文件系统/原生模块?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[Node.js Origin]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要访问数据库?}&#10;    D --&gt;|数据库在特定区域| E{数据库有全球副本?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是(PlanetScale/Turso/Neon)| F[Edge 可行]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[Edge 做缓存层 + Origin 做查询]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| H[Edge 优先]&#10;&#10;    H --&gt; I{计算密集?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是(&gt;50ms CPU)| J[慎用 Edge,考虑 Origin]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[Edge 最优]\">graph TD\n    A{这段逻辑应该放哪里?} --&gt; B{需要文件系统/原生模块?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[Node.js Origin]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要访问数据库?}\n    D --&gt;|数据库在特定区域| E{数据库有全球副本?}\n    E --&gt;|是(PlanetScale/Turso/Neon)| F[Edge 可行]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[Edge 做缓存层 + Origin 做查询]\n    D --&gt;|否| H[Edge 优先]\n\n    H --&gt; I{计算密集?}\n    I --&gt;|是(&gt;50ms CPU)| J[慎用 Edge,考虑 Origin]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[Edge 最优]</pre><p>适合边缘渲染的场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>静态壳 + 个性化注入</strong>：PPR 的静态壳从 CDN 返回，动态部分在 Edge 渲染</li>\n<li><strong>认证/授权检查</strong>：Middleware 在 Edge 验证 JWT，无需回源</li>\n<li><strong>A/B 测试</strong>：在 Edge 决定实验分组，返回不同的页面变体</li>\n<li><strong>地理定位内容</strong>：根据用户位置返回本地化内容/价格/法规信息</li>\n<li><strong>Bot 检测与限流</strong>：在请求到达 Origin 前过滤</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不适合边缘渲染的场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>重型数据库查询（无全球副本）</li>\n<li>需要 Node.js 原生模块的处理（图片变换、PDF 生成）</li>\n<li>长时间运行的计算（ML 推理、大文件处理）</li>\n<li>需要访问本地文件系统的操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"next-js-的-edge-runtime-配置\">Next.js 的 Edge Runtime 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/api/geo-price/route.ts&#10;export const runtime = &#39;edge&#39;; // 声明此路由在 Edge 执行&#10;&#10;export async function GET(request: Request) {&#10;  const country = request.headers.get(&#39;x-vercel-ip-country&#39;) || &#39;US&#39;;&#10;  const prices = await getPricesByRegion(country); // 全球分布的 KV 存储&#10;&#10;  return Response.json(prices, {&#10;    headers: {&#10;      &#39;Cache-Control&#39;: &#39;s-maxage=60, stale-while-revalidate=300&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/api/geo-price/route.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> runtime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'edge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 声明此路由在 Edge 执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> country</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.headers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-vercel-ip-country'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'US'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getPricesByRegion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(country); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 全球分布的 KV 存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prices, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Cache-Control'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'s-maxage=60, stale-while-revalidate=300'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Middleware — 始终在 Edge 执行&#10;// middleware.ts&#10;import { NextResponse } from &#39;next/server&#39;;&#10;import type { NextRequest } from &#39;next/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function middleware(request: NextRequest) {&#10;  // 在 Edge 执行认证检查&#10;  const token = request.cookies.get(&#39;session&#39;);&#10;&#10;  if (!token &amp;&amp; request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(&#39;/dashboard&#39;)) {&#10;    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(&#39;/login&#39;, request.url));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 添加地理信息到请求头&#10;  const response = NextResponse.next();&#10;  response.headers.set(&#39;x-user-country&#39;, request.geo?.country || &#39;unknown&#39;);&#10;  return response;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export const config = {&#10;  matcher: [&#39;/dashboard/:path*&#39;, &#39;/api/:path*&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Middleware — 始终在 Edge 执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// middleware.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NextResponse } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NextRequest } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> middleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NextRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 在 Edge 执行认证检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.cookies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'session'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.nextUrl.pathname.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NextResponse.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/login'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.url));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 添加地理信息到请求头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NextResponse.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  response.headers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-user-country'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.geo?.country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  matcher: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dashboard/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"边缘数据库与全球分布存储\">边缘数据库与全球分布存储</h2><p>边缘渲染的瓶颈通常不是计算，而是数据访问延迟。2026 年的解决方案生态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>全球延迟</th>\n<th>适用数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cloudflare KV</td>\n<td>KV 存储</td>\n<td>&lt;10ms 读</td>\n<td>配置、特性标志、缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudflare D1</td>\n<td>SQLite at Edge</td>\n<td>&lt;50ms</td>\n<td>结构化数据（每个 edge 副本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turso (libSQL)</td>\n<td>分布式 SQLite</td>\n<td>&lt;20ms</td>\n<td>读多写少的应用数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PlanetScale</td>\n<td>分布式 MySQL</td>\n<td>&lt;50ms</td>\n<td>全功能关系数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neon</td>\n<td>分布式 PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>&lt;30ms（hot）</td>\n<td>全功能关系数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Upstash Redis</td>\n<td>全球 Redis</td>\n<td>&lt;5ms</td>\n<td>Session、限流、实时计数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"混合架构-edge-origin-协作\">混合架构：Edge + Origin 协作</h2><p>生产环境中最常见的不是&quot;全量 Edge&quot;或&quot;全量 Origin&quot;，而是<strong>分层混合架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Edge Layer&#10;        M[&quot;Middleware: 认证/限流/地理&quot;]&#10;        SC[Static Cache: PPR Shell]&#10;        ER[Edge Render: 简单动态内容]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Origin Layer&#10;        API[API Routes: 复杂查询]&#10;        SA[Server Actions: 数据变更]&#10;        BG[&quot;Background Jobs: after()&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Data Layer&#10;        KV[Edge KV: 热数据]&#10;        DB[Primary DB: 完整数据]&#10;        Cache[&quot;Redis: Session/限流&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    M --&gt; SC&#10;    M --&gt; ER&#10;    ER --&gt; KV&#10;    ER -.-&gt;|cache miss| API&#10;    API --&gt; DB&#10;    SA --&gt; DB&#10;    BG --&gt; DB\">graph TB\n    subgraph Edge Layer\n        M[\"Middleware: 认证/限流/地理\"]\n        SC[Static Cache: PPR Shell]\n        ER[Edge Render: 简单动态内容]\n    end\n    subgraph Origin Layer\n        API[API Routes: 复杂查询]\n        SA[Server Actions: 数据变更]\n        BG[\"Background Jobs: after()\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Data Layer\n        KV[Edge KV: 热数据]\n        DB[Primary DB: 完整数据]\n        Cache[\"Redis: Session/限流\"]\n    end\n\n    M --&gt; SC\n    M --&gt; ER\n    ER --&gt; KV\n    ER -.-&gt;|cache miss| API\n    API --&gt; DB\n    SA --&gt; DB\n    BG --&gt; DB</pre><h2 id=\"性能基准-edge-vs-origin\">性能基准：Edge vs Origin</h2><p>基于 Next.js 16 实际部署对比（2026 年数据）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>Origin Only (us-east-1)</th>\n<th>Edge + Origin</th>\n<th>改善</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全球 P50 TTFB</td>\n<td>280ms</td>\n<td>45ms</td>\n<td>-84%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球 P95 TTFB</td>\n<td>1200ms</td>\n<td>120ms</td>\n<td>-90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>850ms</td>\n<td>8ms</td>\n<td>-99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日本用户 LCP</td>\n<td>1.8s</td>\n<td>380ms</td>\n<td>-79%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月均计算成本</td>\n<td>$240</td>\n<td>$180（Edge 免费额度）</td>\n<td>-25%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cloudflare-workers-与-vercel-edge-functions-对比\">Cloudflare Workers 与 Vercel Edge Functions 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Cloudflare Workers</th>\n<th>Vercel Edge Functions</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>workerd (V8 Isolate)</td>\n<td>Edge Runtime (V8)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>~0ms（预加载）</td>\n<td>~5ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 限制</td>\n<td>10ms-30s（按计划）</td>\n<td>30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球节点</td>\n<td>300+</td>\n<td>约 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计费模型</td>\n<td>按请求数（免费 10M/月）</td>\n<td>按执行数 + 计算时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架集成</td>\n<td>Remix/Astro/SvelteKit/自定义</td>\n<td>Next.js 优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据产品</td>\n<td>KV/D1/R2/Durable Objects</td>\n<td>依赖外部（Neon/Upstash）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择 Cloudflare 的信号：需要全球极致低延迟、使用 D1/KV/R2 数据栈、非 Next.js 框架。\n选择 Vercel 的信号：使用 Next.js、需要 PPR/ISR 深度集成、偏好平台托管简单性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>边缘渲染的根本价值是消灭物理距离：网络延迟削减约 290ms，远超计算优化的收益</li>\n<li>Edge Runtime 的约束模型：无文件系统、无原生模块、CPU/内存受限，但冷启动仅约 5ms（V8 Isolate）</li>\n<li>适合边缘的场景：静态壳 + 个性化注入、认证授权、A/B 测试、地理定位、Bot 检测与限流</li>\n<li>不适合边缘的场景：无全球副本的重型查询、需原生模块的处理、长时计算、本地文件系统操作</li>\n<li>数据访问延迟是边缘渲染的真正瓶颈，需借助 KV/D1/Turso/PlanetScale/Neon/Upstash 等全球分布存储</li>\n<li>生产环境通常是分层混合架构：Edge 做认证/限流/静态缓存/简单动态，Origin 做复杂查询与数据变更</li>\n<li>Cloudflare Workers 与 Vercel Edge Functions 的选择取决于延迟要求、数据栈与框架生态</li>\n</ul>\n<p>边缘渲染解决了&quot;在哪里做&quot;的问题。下一篇 <a href=\"ssr-caching-patterns\">SSR 缓存模式</a> 解决最后一个维度——&quot;做过的结果怎么存&quot;。三个维度（<a href=\"partial-prerendering\">PPR</a>：什么时候做、本篇：在哪里做、缓存：怎么存）构成完整的渲染优化框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘渲染策略","id":"边缘渲染策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘计算的延迟优势","id":"边缘计算的延迟优势"},{"level":2,"text":"Edge Runtime 的约束模型","id":"edge-runtime-的约束模型"},{"level":2,"text":"架构决策：什么放边缘，什么留 Origin","id":"架构决策-什么放边缘-什么留-origin"},{"level":2,"text":"Next.js 的 Edge Runtime 配置","id":"next-js-的-edge-runtime-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘数据库与全球分布存储","id":"边缘数据库与全球分布存储"},{"level":2,"text":"混合架构：Edge + Origin 协作","id":"混合架构-edge-origin-协作"},{"level":2,"text":"性能基准：Edge vs Origin","id":"性能基准-edge-vs-origin"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloudflare Workers 与 Vercel Edge Functions 对比","id":"cloudflare-workers-与-vercel-edge-functions-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"部分预渲染（PPR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/optimization/partial-prerendering"},"next":{"title":"SSR 缓存模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/optimization/ssr-caching-patterns"}}